  "body": "...Your Development Goldmine Awaits\r\n\r\nYour rare shot at Takapuna’s prime real estate: a well-maintained weatherboard home on a spacious, nearly flat 673m² block. Its located in the Terraced Housing and Apartment Building zone, making it perfect for residential development. Fully prepped and market-ready, it’s tailor-made for investors, developers, and forward-thinking buyers. Tidied up and ready to go, this prized property is available on the market, offering an unparalleled chance for investors, developers, and visionary buyers to secure a distinctive piece of real estate in a coveted location. \r\n\r\nImagine the possibilities in one of Aucklands most sought-after neighbourhoods, where the potential for future development is boundless. Whether you envision a modern grand house, luxurious townhouses, or a unique blend of both, this site offers the flexibility to bring your most ambitious projects to life.\r\n\r\nThis property is in a superb location, within a short walking distance to all the amenities in Takapuna – stunning beaches, an exciting array of restaurants and bars. There are excellent schools on offer including Takapuna Primary, Westlake Girls and Takapuna Grammar, ensuring every educational need is catered to.\r\n\r\nUnlimited potential meets unbeatable location: build modern family homes, luxury townhouses, or a custom mix—this site adapts to your vision. Plus, Takapuna’s perks are at your door: stunning beaches, top-tier dining, shopping, and seamless connectivity via transit and major roads.\r\n\r\nOnce-in-a-lifetime opportunities won't wait. Secure your stake in Takapuna’s most desirable area today. Contact us to dive deeper into this exceptional development opportunity.",
